                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-1">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">How to change the object clause?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Hold Board Meeting, pass Special Resolution (75% majority) at EGM, file Form MGT-14 with ROC Haryana within 30 days. ROC issues fresh Certificate of Incorporation confirming the change. Process takes 15-20 working days. Patron handles the entire process for Gurugram companies.</p></div>
