                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Current MOA/AOA, Board Resolution, EGM notice with explanatory statement, certified Special Resolution, amended MOA with updated Clause III, Director DSC, and CS/CA certificate. Shorter notice consent if applicable.</p></div>
